          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"5-the-ducklake-architecture\">5. The DuckLake Architecture</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Once DLT extracts the data, it loads it into <strong>DuckLake</strong>. </span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">DuckLake solves a massive problem: it gives us a lightweight data lakehouse without needing Spark or a heavy Hive Metastore.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Compute:</strong> Fast, local, in-process analytics using <code>DuckDB</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Storage:</strong> Cheap, decoupled storage using <code>Parquet</code> files on <code>S3</code> or Cloudflare <code>R2</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Metadata:</strong> ACID compliance and multi-user concurrency using a <code>PostgreSQL</code> catalog.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "3fa4ab23f42ec2930043af040e730873",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"query-the-lakehouse\">Query the Lakehouse</h3></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-0' random-id='2bf5d34c-0dba-6428-46b5-3c4d80de3069'><marimo-text-area data-initial-value='&quot;-- Querying the DuckLake Catalog&#92;nSELECT &#92;n    subject, &#92;n    COUNT(*) as pages_crawled, &#92;n    MIN(crawled_at) as first_crawl&#92;nFROM curriculum.curriculum_pages &#92;nWHERE subject IN (&#x27;biology&#x27;, &#x27;chemistry&#x27;)&#92;nGROUP BY subject;&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eTest Query&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true' data-full-width='true' data-rows='6'></marimo-text-area></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-1' random-id='7c163930-34ce-b48a-112d-d43062f58764'><marimo-button data-initial-value='0' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eExecute against DuckLake&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;neutral&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-button></marimo-ui-element></div>"
